{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 71966, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 51326, "uid": 55158, "type": 4, "title": "全资源用法", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1615607589, "updated_at": 1648959930, "updated_uid": 55158, "comment_at": 1673922624, "last_at": 1692627636, "comment_count": 58, "status": 1, "summary": "此贴目的是面向萌新，仅代表我自己，分享资源的用法，可能会有不同的看法。我通常更注重性价比和利用率。有忘记提的可以补充。1.体力体力的来源主要是自动回复（每日288）、重生迷宫（每日150）、地下迷宫（", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639819275774_29107831.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 62, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 117359, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 30, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 71966, "content": "<div>此贴目的是面向萌新，仅代表我自己，分享资源的用法，可能会有不同的看法。我通常更注重性价比和利用率。有忘记提的可以补充。<br></div><div><br><span><span><span><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\">1.体力</span></span></p></div><div><span><span><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;体力的来源主要是自动回复（每日288）、重生迷宫（每日150）、地下迷宫（每日284）。除此以外，还有好友对战（需要脚本）、大小月卡（需要氪金）、活动奖励（随缘）。</span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;体力消耗首先是每日的百鬼夜行。在温泉里的百鬼夜行，建议使用灯笼，能够获得温泉币，共消耗300体力。温泉币只有一个用法，就是在温泉商店里买毛巾。注意，只买毛巾，前期缺灯笼时也可以买灯笼，其他看都不用看。如果你是lsp也可以买一些装饰品。泡温泉的优先级是PVP＞PVE强力刀（作准备）＞Raid/WB强力辅助，注意泡温泉获得的属性挺高的。</span></span></span></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;第二个是每天的10次主线剧情任务。一般是打较新的主线，共250体力。可选的关卡有：①掉落点火素材的，推荐红攻红防素材，适合附魔毕业玩家，点火素材的掉率目前比较低，后续地图应该会更高；②掉落附魔材料的，推荐武器附魔、饰品附魔、矿石材料，适合没有经历过3倍附魔的玩家、经历过但附魔没有毕业的玩家，几张偏后的图附魔材料掉率挺高的；③掉落2星火石头的，适合打不过上述后期主线关卡的萌新玩家。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;最后是不定期的翻牌。每日消耗240体力，因为每日会送100体力刚好补上缺口。</div><div><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;多余的体力通常是刷主线，除了上述提到的点火、附魔素材外，还可以得到2星天子，后面会说。</span></span></span>补充：2红火石头全名火属性水晶粉，是进化素材，火属性天子升星必需品。</div><div><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">2.钻石</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></p></div></span></span></span></span></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;钻石的来源主要是每日任务（每日950）、探索（每日500）、PVP（周结）、每日赠送（免费的附魔素材箱，附赠270钻石，无须邮箱领取）、<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">玛门的支援（Tap服没有，建议选钻石，每日360）</span>。<br></div><div><br></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;钻石最有用的当然是抽新天子，其中性价比最高的是必中池（抽到的5星必定是封面天子，抽到一只后不可再抽取）。超强的天子的单up池和优质的双up池，也是可以抽的。除此以外，每日限定一次的百六池（五星几率6%）、常驻池、大部分4up池（出五星只会是四种天子），普通双up池都不建议抽。有些4up池非常好，依抽卡建议抽取。攒石是游戏的重要一环。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;大多数魂卡池不建议抽，除非很强。如果要抽魂卡，建议抽+0然后用素材往上堆就行。</div><div><br></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;钻石买点火素材也是不错的，稳定的战力提升。皮肤塔的刷新需要1900钻，可以适当刷，别上头，出胎五（即使已经+6）或者没有的皮肤就可以，不要强求五星券。补充：胎五指的是原生五星天子，4星天子也可以升到5星但不是胎五。</div><div><br></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;还有一个Raid/WB的氪票问题。我的建议是Raid不要氪票，WB适当氪票以搬商店。</div><div><br></div><div><span><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">3.玛瑙</span></p></div></span><br></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;玛瑙的来源主要是每日PVP任务、活动奖励、分解天子。商店有每月玛瑙礼包，看情况买。</div><div><br></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;玛瑙的消耗量很大，省着点。主要是升技能、觉醒天子、点火。</div><div><br></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">升技能看百科全书：<span style=\"\">https://docs.qq.com/sheet/DTnd6cUNFaVVhcndZ?tab=BB08J2</span></span></div><div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639819275774_29107831.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639819275774_29107831.png\" style=\"width: 391px; height: 360px;\"></div><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">要用什么技能就加什么技能，技能预约里没有的就不用加</span></div><div>例：鲁邦技能预约中有S也有T，故S和T都必须点满。</div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">还有额外的几条准则：</span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">①PVP角色所有技能必须加满</span>（竞技场技能预约无效，全是随机放的）</div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">②攻击型天子的T技能必须加满</span>（影响到FT伤害）</div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">③普攻除PVP角色均不点</span>（提升无限接近与0）</div><div><span><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">4.金币</span></p></div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;金币的来源主要是每日金币关卡，大量获得的方式是Raid，没错，Raid其实就是给你刷金币的。</span><br></div><div><span><br></span></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;需要用到金币的地方非常多，天子升星、天子突破界限、附魔道具合成、强化魂卡、合成进化素材等等。金币要多攒，最推荐方式就是开脚本打Raid。经历数次Raid，金币富余时，每日3次金币池抽卡抽满。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Raid刷金币。打特殊的史莱姆boss（可挂脚本）。活动结束后，多余的诸神币会1:10换成金币，所以Raid中不必要的商品不用换，换之前自己算一算就懂了。</div><div><span><br></span></div><div><span><span><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">5.红石</span></p></div></span><br></span></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 红石主要来源是每日任务、玛门的支援、每周乱斗前百奖励。翻牌活动有机会大量刷取（需要抽当期翻牌加成天子的池子+看脸）。红石不推荐直接用来抽卡，因为红石池子是宇宙池，啥都有。</div><div><br></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;红石推荐用法是①买皮肤；②攒着。红石性价比最高的用法是还魂，看<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/69215.html\" target=\"_blank\">这里</a>。红石攒着等还魂双倍非洲条就完了。除此以外，红石商店半价时，也可以在红石商店里购买一键满级史莱姆，加快成型速度。</div><div><br></div><div><span><span><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">6.天子</span></p></div><div><span><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;补充：天子在满级时，会赠送星级*10的钻石（1星除外），2星就是20钻，同一天子可以反复触发。</span></span></div><div><span><span><br></span></span></div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1星天子。来源较少，直接分解即可。</span><br></span></div><div><span><span><br></span></span></div><div><span><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2星天子。主要来源是刷主线，一般是投入探索，探索可以在一定时间后自动获得经验。2星的话，12小时+12小时或者12+6+1即可满级，每天会消耗25个2星，多刷主线或者抽金币池（金币富余）补充。</span></span></div><div><span><span><br></span></span></div><div><span><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3星天子。直接分解即可，可留下部分准备乱斗，留哪些看乱斗攻略。</span></span></div><div><br></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4星天子。非火属性4星天子可以带在队伍里刷到40级升星到5星，给胎五天子升六星时，当素材吃。目的是缓解火石头紧缺的压力。直接分解也可。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;特殊的，4星火史莱姆，自带40级满级，可直接升到5星。这种史莱姆只有火属性，而升星是需要对应属性石头的，所以火石头会很缺。后面会讲。</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;5星天子，胎五。多出来的胎五优先满足点火使用，多出来的拿去还魂。胎五拿去升星就是浪费。</div><div><br></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;狗粮天子。1~4星狗粮喂给需要的天子即可，5星狗粮建议保留以备不时之需。</div><div><br></div><div><span><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">7.装备及魂卡</span></p></div></span><br></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;装备的主要来源是地下迷宫、活动奖励。目前活动赠送的装备都是勉强可以用的，装备强弱看<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/27663.html\" target=\"_blank\">这里</a>。多余的装备用法如下。</div><div><br></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1星~3星装备。直接出售即可，因为强化装备、魂卡是非常消耗金币的，低等级装备强化的性价比非常低。当然紧急情况下，3星装备用来强化也不是不行</div><div><br></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4星~5星装备。强化装备和魂卡。一般来说，前期强化出几套满级装备后，就可以等活动赠送的装备研磨剂（+1、+3等）慢慢把满级装备数量补满，研磨剂直接加装备等级，前期也可以用来补最后几级。更多的装备用来强化魂卡。</div><div><br></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;低星魂卡的来源非常少，因为抽魂卡池的性价比是很低的，一般不会抽魂卡池。低星魂卡只能用作狗粮，提升魂卡的加值，而不能提升魂卡的等级。一般都是通过5星魂卡券和活动奖励直接获得5星魂卡或是魂卡狗粮。这里得提到一个常驻任务，每期活动的新天子都会有对应的天子养成任务，+5以前每次提升加值都可以得到魂卡狗粮，依靠该任务，平民玩家也可以攒出大量的魂卡狗粮，堪称策划的怜悯。</div><div><br></div><div><span><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">8.进化素材</span></p></div><div><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;除了火石头一般不会缺的，就不提了。火属性石头缺的根本原因是大量使用4星火史莱姆升5星，以提供胎五天子升6星的素材。</span></div><div><span><br></span></div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1星火石头。主要来源是火属性的每日地下城。金币多可以用来合成2星火石头。可能会缺。</span><br></div><div><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2星火石头。主要来源是火属性的每日地下城。一般会很缺，比较好的补充方法是用1星火石头合成。</span></span><br></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3星火石头。主要来源是刷主线剧情。在选择关卡时，通常会选带有3星火石头的主线关卡。如果这么做是不会缺的。</span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4星火石头。主要来源是PVP商店购买。看见就买，存个100多个就行。不会特别缺。</span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;5星火、水、木、光、暗石头。主要是来源是PVP商店购买和4星合成。一般不会缺。</span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><span><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">9.活动素材</span></p></div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;几乎所有活动素材都是可以卖金币的，虽然不多。在活动结束以后可以卖掉，看看清楚，别把当期活动素材卖了。</span><br></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><span><br></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><span><span><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">10.附魔素材</span></p></div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;主要来源是每日赠送、主线关卡、活动奖励。</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">攒着，等下一次3倍附魔。不急的，实在着急的话，可以把武器1号位的c级加攻击力刷出来，给刀用，其余不建议刷。</span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><span><span><span><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">11.点火核心</span><span></span></p></div></span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;点火核心的制作需要点火素材+胎五。切记，要用的时候才点火，不要提前点火。对于非刀卡天子，关键是技能变化，点到所需的技能变化即可。比如需要3红，点到3红以后，旁边的两个副属性就不要点了。对于刀卡天子，在满足需要的强度要求下点火，比如青钢影，2红就足以Raid稳定斩车，那么就不用继续点，因为青钢影WB和PVP并不厉害；部分不点火下的SS四连刀6红后变为SS六连刀，六连刀PVE都是可以一用，有的六连刀PVP很强，有的PVP废物。总体来说，SS六连刀是开荒前期最值得投资点火的。</span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><span><span><span><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">12.召唤券</span></p></div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;狗粮召唤券。如果不是紧急需要，可以攒着以备不时之需。</span><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><span><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;5星天子召唤券。当+6天子非常少的时候，直接开就行。有很多+6天子时，攒一段时间一起开，能开出更多较新的天子。</span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><span><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;5星魂卡召唤券。当手上强力魂卡很少时，可以直接开。魂卡够用时，攒到你需要的魂卡实装时一起开。</span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><span><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;十连券。建议攒着，和红石一起攒。等到双倍还魂开启，就可以全开瞬间获得大量4星天子，来一波还魂。</span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><span><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;装备券。直接开即可。</span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;其余。看情况使用。</div><div><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-v